623335", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035460_8514674871956668_5536053659043017688_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wLo5J86wfVkQ7kNvwE9pj94&_nc_oc=AdqbQgoVScTIgAYERhqPe7JN0DVY7PzsLS0AknOBzQucjBWJSmxLk0Rq4tILPSVOUp4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN9SMTckzVKmmPkGMNUK5N3zY5PR2uvtEH1yNV_HqJ9rw&oe=6AC64862"}, "display_name": "RCP VR", "keywords": ["CPR", "Training", "FirstAid", "Life", "Medical"], "long_description": "Have you ever wondered how you would react in a medical emergency?\n\nImagine this: you're at work, in a shopping mall, or walking down the street, and suddenly, someone collapses next to you. Would you know what to do?\n\nAt Four Players VR, we\u2019ve developed a Virtual Reality Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) simulation that trains you to act with confidence and effectiveness in critical situations.\n\nGet ready to save lives:\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator).\n\nDon\u2019t let fear paralyze you. Join us and gain the skills you need to make a difference in critical moments with Four Players VR!", "short_description": "\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero Cover 3000x900-01.png", "id": "1521375421828587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982664_1521375425161920_9188152085567170692_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZUk-olVdx40Q7kNvwG0QaKr&_nc_oc=AdrVzcrc9aaw1c9TMD6X75Jy-WjJc5McHAfjkky2Ty42Hv9UqA6grxFB5MFFfOCnWL0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNTb3JPTPi_CYCiV0aNwLWkeVIudyQt9dYAm7-sqU6Qtw&oe=6AC655F3"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Square 1440x1440-01.png", "id": "1067684668157887", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75221326_1067684671491220_581184548072541025_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A_ebNEC4bBgQ7kNvwE_ihgd&_nc_oc=AdoPxsgp8gi6OA4ZYX4YABnhoICzuAnQNZa-Og_7g7YWXLeyTmobAy43lSlPv9ZZzLc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNxls3Y9SbeWZUm4KjOiAjenfVCeTy11dhUeA8Wy8y7sQ&oe=6AC64A6B"}, {"file_name": "Logo 9000x1440-01.png", "id": "875705051208789", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75339313_875705054542122_3606485636804263314_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R_ED3yuKuysQ7kNvwFrFt8r&_nc_oc=Adogp9DneSEhpmSzFqjjmSGCJTMLtj0aZNGX9sa4Cmd9_fXXzOZHyJ83eDrBsTHc2MQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMEw5mKvbLkNqPonFoUzwLxys77XYTA-AQUuHg6yV84IQ&oe=6AC667A2"}, {"file_name": "Icon 512x512-01.png", "id": "581195491100081", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568678_581195494433414_3254618470938933182_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xWQgC4JHvYoQ7kNvwFchSxu&_nc_oc=Ado-28hP-XrDsp77JB5DSIgLK6V5DgFh8wlHvZN7yXnLs-rGviblLxaQyXK8vsTmXUc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMHLSgYQ5gxCQtBCZ4AxAMAKMsMzSnF1-stt2E0GXt-yw&oe=6AC66A3D"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Landscape 1008x1440-01.png", "id": "480126738396124", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982658_480126745062790_195688056568553292